WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A journey begins. Wisdom · Devotion · Courage · Harmony

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Mouse Run. Run through Kailash. Gather wisdom.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Mountain Adventure. Leap between islands. Find your way.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Petals of Light. Aim gently. Let your offering fly.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Diya Puzzle. Watch. Listen. Remember the light.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Ganesha Puzzle. Bring a beautiful picture together.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Mantra Memory. Every pair is a connection.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Flower Offering. Arrange a garden of devotion.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Hidden Symbols. Look a little closer.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:21.000
Rhythm of Devotion. Find your rhythm. Make your own music.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.000
The Tusk and the Mahabharata. A traditional retelling. A timeless lesson.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.000
A moment of prayer. Your journey is waiting.
